{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modifications for Urban Chaos</strong> (1999, from Eidos / Mucky Foot):</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Police disguise mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First Person View (FPS).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix lag/instability in side view button.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more auto-aim, which improves precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more some automatic features, like enemies showing up on &quot;radar/gps&quot;, thus increasing the challenge, the immersion and realism.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No more &quot;thug uniform&quot; - now any citizen is a thug in potential.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backup is unnecessary. It doesn't change any game files.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3992700?t=1758033803","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992700/7dcb0eb6c265abf3a42e042cb7de974b9cd10e5c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758033803","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992700/d02225743f43302ca31cb9a5c8110bd0d2ecfc7d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758033803","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3992700/d02225743f43302ca31cb9a5c8110bd0d2ecfc7d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758033803","categories":[{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This is a modification that does NOT change the emotional experience of the original game. The game de